msgid "刘安禄"
msgstr "Liu Anlu"

msgid "门房"
msgstr "Gatekeeper"

msgid "看见你，放下了手里的扫帚。"
msgstr " sees you and sets down his broom."

msgid "李教头同我说了。……那句话是你替我挡的。"
msgstr "Instructor Li told me. ...You took that one for me."

msgid "我欠你一句话。哪天你用得着野羊山的人，开口。"
msgstr "I owe you one. Day you need somebody from Goathill, just say the word."

msgid "背着一个青布包袱，望着往野羊山去的那条路。"
msgstr " has a blue cloth bundle on his back, eyes on the road to Goathill."

msgid "话是你说的。我不怨你——五年前我就该走。"
msgstr "You said it. I don't hold it against you — I should've left five years ago."

msgid "馆主留我到今天，是他的情分；武馆的规矩，是老馆主的。两样都没错。"
msgstr "The master kept me on till today. That was his kindness. The hall's rules were the old master's. Neither one was wrong."

msgid "刘安禄的来历不简单。当面问出这个名字，是把事情挑明——他未必肯善罢甘休。要问吗？"
msgstr "There's more to Liu Anlu than meets the eye. Saying this name to his face drags it all into the open — he may not take that lying down. Ask anyway?"

msgid "……老子认了，还问什么。你要问野羊寨的事，问大寨主。"
msgstr "...I've owned up to it. What's left to ask? You want to know about Goathill Stockade, ask the Chief."

msgid "老子就是血手刘三，血手刘三就是你老子！纳命来！"
msgstr "I'm Bloody-Hand Liu, and Bloody-Hand Liu is your old man! Come and die!"

msgid "我...不知道！"
msgstr "I... I don't know!"

msgid "血手刘三"
msgstr "Bloody-Hand Liu"

msgid "刘安禄眼中突然放出异样的光芒，颤声说道：看来...你都知道了？"
msgstr "A strange light flares in Liu Anlu's eyes. His voice shakes. \"So... you know everything?\""

msgid "刘安禄大喝一声，叫道：既然如此，老子今天豁出去了，纳命来！"
msgstr "Liu Anlu lets out a roar. \"Fine, then! Today I got nothin' left to lose — come and die!\""

msgid "刘安禄使开单刀，招数精奇，沈猛狠辣，和刚才简直判若两人！"
msgstr "Liu Anlu cuts loose with his saber — tricky, savage, ruthless. He's a different man from a moment ago!"

msgid "刘安禄沉默了半晌，低声道：野羊寨的大寨主霍铮，是我拜过把子的大哥。"
msgstr "Liu Anlu is silent a long while. Then, low: \"Huo Zheng, Chief of Goathill Stockade — he's my sworn big brother.\""

msgid "半年前，北麓那座黑砖道观的道士上山要人。大哥跟他们走了，再没回来。那伙人自称逆灵宫。"
msgstr "Half a year back, Daoists from that black-brick abbey on the north slope came up the mountain asking for him. Big Brother went with 'em and never came back. That lot calls itself the Black Palace."

msgid "黄霸——老三——把寨子接了过去，每年给道观纳供，金帛、牲口，要什么送什么。我不肯伺候那群臭道士，就下了山。"
msgstr "Huang Ba — our Third — took over the stockade. Pays the abbey tribute every year: gold, silk, livestock, whatever they want. I wasn't gonna wait on those stinking Daoists hand and foot, so I came down the mountain."

msgid "纳供的车这几天就上山。到了山路转角，道士从北边山壁的裂口把东西吊上去——道观就在裂口上头。你要去，替我看一眼大哥。"
msgstr "The tribute carts go up any day now. At the bend in the mountain road, the Daoists haul the goods up through a crack in the north cliff — the abbey sits right on top of it. If you're going, take a look at my big brother for me."

msgid "……大哥的事，等你知道野羊山北麓是个什么地方再说。"
msgstr "...Big Brother's business can wait till you know what kind of place the north slope of Goathill is."

msgid "大寨主？我是淳风武馆的门房，哪来的什么大寨主。"
msgstr "Chief? I'm the gatekeeper at Pure Wind Hall. What chief?"

msgid "野羊山寨二寨主"
msgstr "Second Chief of Goathill Stockade"

msgid "武馆弟子"
msgstr "Hall Disciple"

msgid "店小二"
msgstr "Waiter"

msgid "小二哥"
msgstr "waiter"

msgid "笑咪咪地说道：这位$RESPECT，进来喝杯茶，歇歇腿吧。"
msgstr " says with a grin, \"Come on in for a cup of tea and rest your legs, $RESPECT.\""

msgid "用脖子上的毛巾抹了抹手，说道：这位$RESPECT，请进请进。"
msgstr " wipes his hands on the towel round his neck. \"Come in, come in, $RESPECT!\""

msgid "这位$RESPECT，进来喝几盅小店的红酒吧，这几天才从窖子里开封的哟。"
msgstr "Come in for a cup or two of our red wine, $RESPECT — only just unsealed from the cellar!"

msgid "鸡腿骨头别扔，东街那两条野狗见了骨头就跟人走，怪得很。"
msgstr "Don't toss those chicken bones. The two strays on East Street'll follow anybody with a bone. Funny thing."

msgid "哟，可算清净了！来，刚烤好的鸡腿，小店的一点心意。"
msgstr "Ooh, peace and quiet at last! Here — a fresh-roasted chicken leg, on the house."

msgid "唉，别提了。楼上几间客房闹老鼠，客人嫌吵，掌柜的又舍不得请人。这位$RESPECT要是肯上去收拾收拾，小店请您吃顿热的。"
msgstr "Ugh, don't get me started. Rats in the rooms upstairs, the guests complain about the racket, and the boss is too stingy to hire anybody. If you'd go up and clear them out, $RESPECT, there's a hot meal in it for you."

msgid "多亏了您！……他们把您楼上那屋翻了个底朝天，问那只匣子问了三遍，小的说不知道。"
msgstr "Thank heavens for you! ...They turned your room upstairs inside out and asked about that casket three times. I told them I didn't know a thing."

msgid "掌柜的说了：楼上那间屋给您留着，往后不收钱。您是咱们雪亭的人。"
msgstr "The boss says the room upstairs is yours, free from now on. You're one of us Snow Pavilion folk."

msgid "捂着青了半边的脸，压低了声音。"
msgstr " covers the bruised half of his face and drops his voice."

msgid "两个白衣的官爷，拿着一张画像，说您是什么逆灵宫的同党……就在里头翻呢！掌柜的拦了一下，挨了一脚。"
msgstr "Two officials in white, with a portrait — saying you're in league with the Black Palace or some such... they're tearing the place apart in there! The boss tried to stop them and got a boot for it."

msgid "白衣人？前些日子广场上那队官爷，都是穿白的。"
msgstr "Men in white? That troop of officials in the square the other day — they all wore white."

msgid "外头广场上来了官爷，一队白衣的武官，还有两位老者坐着，说是大内来的高手。这位$RESPECT要是闲，去瞧瞧热闹也好。"
msgstr "There's officials out in the square — a troop of officers in white, and two old gents sitting with them. Masters from the Palace, they say. If you've got the time, $RESPECT, go have a look. Quite the show."

msgid "小哥您有所不知，这些个爷儿们是奉了咱们皇上的命令，要去岚城找一把叫做什麽『旋芒宝剑』的。他们等的白道长，便是咱们这附近有名的太乙观观主。"
msgstr "You wouldn't know, friend — these fine gentlemen are on His Majesty's own orders, off to Lancheng to find some sword they call the Whirling Edge. The Daoist Bai they're waiting on, he's the abbot of Taiyi Abbey, famous round these parts."

msgid "$RESPECT，您来的那天傍晚说是来投淳风武馆的，饭没吃完就困得睁不开眼，是小的扶您上的楼。这封信落在桌上了，小的一直替您收着呢。"
msgstr "The evening you got here, $RESPECT, you said you'd come to join Pure Wind Hall — then you could hardly keep your eyes open before you'd finished supper, and I helped you up the stairs. You left this letter on the table. I've been keeping it for you."

msgid "从柜台底下摸出一封折了又折的信，递给你。"
msgstr " pulls a letter, folded over and over, from under the counter and hands it to you."

msgid "对了，外头广场上来了官爷，一队白衣的武官，还有两位老者坐着，说是大内来的高手。$RESPECT要是闲，去瞧瞧热闹也好。"
msgstr "Oh, and — there's officials out in the square. A troop of officers in white, and two old gents sitting with them. Masters from the Palace, they say. If you've got the time, $RESPECT, go have a look."

msgid "这些个爷儿们是奉了咱们皇上的命令，要去岚城找一把叫做什麽『旋芒宝剑』的。他们等的白道长，便是咱们这附近有名的太乙观观主。"
msgstr "These fine gentlemen are on His Majesty's own orders, off to Lancheng to find some sword they call the Whirling Edge. The Daoist Bai they're waiting on, he's the abbot of Taiyi Abbey, famous round these parts."

msgid "请柬早给您了。正月十七，水烟阁外头的虹台——您可别忘了。"
msgstr "I gave you the invitation already. Seventeenth of the first month, the Rainbow Terrace outside Waterfog Pavilion — don't you forget."

msgid "哟，您可回来了！前两天水烟阁差人送来一张帖子，指名道姓给您的。"
msgstr "Well, look who's back! Couple days ago Waterfog Pavilion sent a man over with an invitation — addressed to you, by name."

msgid "从柜台底下摸出一张大红帖子，在围裙上擦了擦手，双手递给你。"
msgstr " pulls a big red invitation card from under the counter, wipes his hands on his apron, and offers it to you with both hands."

msgid "请柬？没有您的信啊。"
msgstr "An invitation? Nothing's come for you."

msgid "看见你进门，眼睛一亮，从柜台后头钻了出来。"
msgstr " spots you coming in, lights up, and scurries out from behind the counter."

msgid "$RESPECT，您可回来了！前两天水烟阁差人送来一张帖子，指名道姓给您的。"
msgstr "You're back at last, $RESPECT! Couple days ago Waterfog Pavilion sent a man over with an invitation — addressed to you, by name."

msgid "正月十七，水烟阁外头的虹台，九派选盟主——小的长这么大，还没见过咱们雪亭的人拿这种帖子。"
msgstr "Seventeenth of the first month, at the Rainbow Terrace outside Waterfog Pavilion, the nine schools pick an Alliance Leader. All my life I never saw one of us Snow Pavilion folk get an invitation like that."

msgid "柳绘心"
msgstr "Liu Huixin"

msgid "封山剑派北宗"
msgstr "Empty Mountain School, North Branch"

msgid "弟子"
msgstr "Disciple"

msgid "我每天夜里读一页。爹爹年轻的时候，字写得比现在放得开。"
msgstr "I read one page every night. When Father was young, his hand was freer than it is now."

msgid "爹爹把它锁起来了，是不是？……他什么都锁起来。"
msgstr "Father locked it away, didn't he? ...He locks everything away."

msgid "爹爹在天驼关写过一卷书，我只听李教头提过一句。他从来不让我看。"
msgstr "Father wrote a book at Camelback Pass. Instructor Li mentioned it once, that's all. Father never lets me see it."

msgid "虹台上的事还没完。等散了会再说。"
msgstr "The Rainbow Terrace business isn't over. Let's talk once the gathering breaks up."

msgid "北宗现在有两个人了。"
msgstr "The North Branch has two people now."

msgid "你选了爹爹那一边。我不怪你。"
msgstr "You chose Father's side. I don't blame you."

msgid "的眼圈红了一下，很快又忍了回去。"
msgstr "'s eyes redden for a moment. She quickly holds it back."

msgid "那北宗就有两个人了。"
msgstr "Then the North Branch has two people."

msgid "「点」字诀爹爹没教过我，是我自己看他练剑悟的：劲不在手臂上，在剑尖上。你看——"
msgstr "Father never taught me the \"Point\" technique. I worked it out watching him practice: the force isn't in your arm. It's in the tip of the sword. Look —"

msgid "的细剑平平递出，剑尖在廊柱上一点，柱子背面迸出一小块木屑。"
msgstr "'s slender sword slides straight out. Its tip touches a pillar of the walkway — and a chip of wood bursts from the far side."

msgid "内力不够的时候别使，剑会脱手。我脱过好几回。"
msgstr "Don't use it when your inner force is low — the sword'll fly out of your hand. Mine has, plenty of times."

msgid "爹爹不会再教你了。对不起。……可是阿桂他们，往后也算你的师弟师妹。"
msgstr "Father won't teach you anymore. I'm sorry. ...But Agui and the others — from now on they're your juniors too."

msgid "北宗？绮云镇口的公告上还这么写呢。爹爹说那是旧名。"
msgstr "The North Branch? The notice at the Cloudweave Town gate still says so. Father says that's an old name."

msgid "劲不在手臂上，在剑尖上。内力不够别使，剑会脱手。"
msgstr "The force isn't in your arm. It's in the tip of the sword. Don't use it when your inner force is low — the sword'll fly out of your hand."

msgid "爹爹练剑的时候，我在窗后头看过。"
msgstr "When Father practiced, I used to watch from behind the window."

msgid "正月十七的事过去了。北宗的剑，照旧教人。"
msgstr "The seventeenth is behind us. The North Branch's sword still teaches."

msgid "北宗这一票，正月十七照你说的投。"
msgstr "The North Branch votes the way you said, on the seventeenth."

msgid "颜违许了北宗一个座。北宗能在虹台上坐下来，是你陪我走出来的——这一票投颜违，是说好了的。"
msgstr "Yan Wei promised the North Branch a seat. We got to sit on the Rainbow Terrace because you walked out with me — this vote goes to Yan Wei. That was the deal."

msgid "把剑在膝上横过来，想了想。"
msgstr " lays the sword across her knees and thinks it over."

msgid "可你要是想自己站出来，这一票我给你。"
msgstr "But if you want to stand up yourself, this vote is yours."

msgid "虹台？那是爹爹的事。"
msgstr "The Rainbow Terrace? That's Father's business."

msgid "虹台上已经入了席。票就是票了。"
msgstr "We've taken our seats on the Rainbow Terrace. A vote is a vote."

msgid "封山那一票在爹爹手里。你去问他。"
msgstr "The Empty Mountain vote is in Father's hands. Go ask him."

msgid "说过了。北宗听你的。"
msgstr "We've been through this. The North Branch goes with you."

msgid "笑了一下。"
msgstr " smiles a little."

msgid "好。北宗的座，听你的。"
msgstr "All right. The North Branch's seat is yours to call."

msgid "……"
msgstr "......"

msgid "这是爹爹收起来的那一卷……你从哪里拿来的？还回去吧。"
msgstr "This is the book Father put away... Where did you get it? Put it back."

msgid "接过书，翻开第一页，手停住了。"
msgstr " takes the book and opens to the first page. Her hand stops."

msgid "「直竹贵地生，风吹动不止」……这是爹爹的字。他从来没给我看过。"
msgstr "\"Straight bamboo, rooted deep in good earth; the wind blows, and it never stops moving.\" ...This is Father's hand. He never showed me this."

msgid "「起迄中空立，随风飘不定」——原来他年轻的时候，也想过剑可以是弯的。"
msgstr "\"Hollow it stands, from root to tip; it sways with the wind, never still.\" — So when he was young, he thought a sword could bend too."

msgid "把书抱在怀里。"
msgstr " hugs the book to her chest."

msgid "你……过两日到内院来。我给你看一样东西。别告诉爹爹。"
msgstr "You... come to the inner court in a couple of days. I want to show you something. Don't tell Father."

msgid "这上头是……爹爹的名字？你先去见过爹爹再说吧。"
msgstr "Is this... Father's name on it? Go and see Father first."

msgid "北宗就我们两个人，打坏了谁教阿桂他们？"
msgstr "There's only two of us in the North Branch. If one of us gets hurt, who teaches Agui and the rest?"

msgid "师姐！别整天想著练功嘛，我们去花园摘花儿玩嘛？"
msgstr "Big Sister! Don't think about training all day — let's go pick flowers in the garden, okay?"

msgid "我才不要，你们去找李教头练吧！"
msgstr "No way! Go train with Instructor Li!"

msgid "爹爹说过，不能跟你们这些江湖人物比武过招。"
msgstr "Father says I'm not allowed to spar with you jianghu types."

msgid "柳淳风"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng"

msgid "风雨双侠"
msgstr "the Wind-and-Rain Swordsman"

msgid "柳馆主"
msgstr "Master Liu"

msgid "封山剑派"
msgstr "Empty Mountain School"

msgid "掌门人"
msgstr "Master"

msgid "书在匣里。年轻时的糊涂话，留着给自己看。"
msgstr "The book is in the box. Foolish words from my youth. I keep them for myself."

msgid "书在绘心那里。……她读得比我当年明白。"
msgstr "The book is with Huixin. ...She reads it more clearly than I did at her age."

msgid "竹林道尽头那块大黄石，照我教你的法子推。书取出来，带回来。"
msgstr "The big yellow boulder at the end of the bamboo path — push it the way I taught you. Take the book out, and bring it back."

msgid "看着窗外的竹影，半晌才开口。"
msgstr " looks at the bamboo shadows outside the window for a long time before he speaks."

msgid "二十岁那年，我在天驼关的竹林里住过一冬，悟出一点架剑的道理，写成一卷，起名《悟疾风劲竹书》，留在竹林尽头的石室里。"
msgstr "The year I turned twenty, I spent a winter in the bamboo grove at Camelback Pass. I came to understand a little about how a sword holds its ground, and I wrote it into a book. I called it \"Bamboo Against the Gale,\" and I left it in the stone chamber at the far end of the grove."

msgid "石室的口子有一块大黄石堵着。硬推，没有几十年的内力推不动——我当年也推不动。"
msgstr "A great yellow boulder blocks the mouth of the chamber. Shove it, and without decades of inner force it will not move. I could not move it then, either."

msgid "那块石头不是那样推的。贴着它左下角那道青苔印，肩抵住，脚蹬石根；等风过竹林、石头自己松那一下，再发力。竹子是这么弯的，石头也是这么开的。"
msgstr "That is not how the stone is pushed. Set your shoulder against the moss mark at its lower left, brace your feet at its base, and wait — when the wind runs through the bamboo, the stone gives a little on its own. Push then. That is how bamboo bends, and that is how the stone opens."

msgid "书只有那一本。你替我取出来。"
msgstr "There is only the one copy. Bring it out for me."

msgid "一卷旧书罢了。"
msgstr "Just an old book."

msgid "本宗的规矩，从今往后是你我两个人守。"
msgstr "From now on, the rules of our school are kept by two people: you and me."

msgid "你选了。武馆的门不拦你——只是剑，我不能再教了。"
msgstr "You have chosen. The hall's door is not closed to you — but the sword, I can no longer teach you."

msgid "点了点头，像是早知道，又像是松了一口气。"
msgstr " nods, as if he knew all along — or as if something has been lifted from him."

msgid "好。那从今日起，「点」字诀归你。"
msgstr "Good. Then from today, the \"Point\" technique is yours."

msgid "平时使剑，内力聚在手臂上；「点」字诀把劲力聚在剑尖，以意使剑。刺出去的那一下，比你现在重得多——内力不够的时候别使，剑会脱手。"
msgstr "When you use a sword, your inner force gathers in your arm. The \"Point\" technique gathers it in the tip of the blade, and the mind drives the sword. That one thrust strikes far harder than anything you have now. Do not use it when your inner force is low — the sword will leave your hand."

msgid "拔出玄苏剑，剑尖在你面前的青砖上轻轻一点。砖没有裂，砖下的土陷下去一个指头深的坑。"
msgstr " draws his sword and touches its tip lightly to the stone tile in front of you. The tile does not crack. The earth beneath it sinks a finger deep."

msgid "封山这一辈，掌门的剑往后传给你。"
msgstr "In this generation of Empty Mountain, the Master's sword passes to you."

msgid "绘心……她要走，我不拦。"
msgstr "Huixin... If she wants to leave, I will not stop her."

msgid "封山剑派只有一宗。"
msgstr "There is only one Empty Mountain School."

msgid "劲在剑尖，意在剑先。内力不够的时候别使。"
msgstr "The force in the tip, the mind ahead of the sword. Do not use it when your inner force is low."

msgid "绘心自己悟的那一路，劲发得早了半分。你替我告诉她——不，不必说是我说的。"
msgstr "The way Huixin worked out for herself releases the force a hair too early. Tell her for me — no. No need to say it came from me."

msgid "「点」字诀是掌门一脉单传的。"
msgstr "The \"Point\" technique passes from Master to heir, one at a time."

msgid "镇上清净了。门户的名头不是谁都能借的——这一回，是你替武馆拿回来的。"
msgstr "The town is quiet again. Not just anyone may borrow our school's name — this time, you won it back for the hall."

msgid "镇西官道上那几个人，你去会一会。先看清他们凭的是什么，再动手。"
msgstr "Those men on the road west of town — go and meet them. See first what they are relying on. Then act."

msgid "放下手里的茶，看了你一眼。"
msgstr " sets down his tea and looks at you."

msgid "既入了门，武馆的事你也该担一件。"
msgstr "You have joined us. It is time you shouldered some of the hall's business."

msgid "这几日有来投师的人说，在镇西的青石官道上交过「拜师钱」——十两银子，收钱的自称封山弟子。淳风武馆收徒，从来不收这个钱。"
msgstr "These past few days, people who came to join us say they paid an \"entrance fee\" on the Bluestone Road west of town — ten taels of silver, to men calling themselves Empty Mountain disciples. Pure Wind Hall has never charged a student a single coin."

msgid "我不便去。掌门出手打几个骗子，传出去是笑话。你是新面孔，他们不认得你——去看看他们凭的是什么。"
msgstr "It would not do for me to go. A Master beating up a few swindlers would be the joke of the town. You are a new face; they will not know you. Go and see what they are relying on."

msgid "武馆自家的事，不劳外人费心。"
msgstr "The hall's own affairs are no concern of outsiders."

msgid "牌我收着。逄师弟什么时候自己来取，什么时候还他。"
msgstr "I will keep the token. Whenever Brother Pang comes for it himself, he shall have it back."

msgid "他认了就好。牌给我吧。"
msgstr "If he has owned up, that is enough. Give me the token."

msgid "牌没带回来？……丢了也好，省得再有人拿它骗人。"
msgstr "You did not bring the token back? ...Perhaps it is as well it is lost. No one else can cheat with it."

msgid "门户的名头，不是谁都能借的。这件事你办得干净——从今日起，你是这一辈的大弟子。"
msgstr "Not just anyone may borrow our school's name. You handled this cleanly — from today, you are the senior disciple of your generation."

msgid "还有一件事，李教头会同你说。"
msgstr "There is one more thing. Instructor Li will tell you."

msgid "接过腰牌翻过来，看见背面那个字，半晌没有说话。"
msgstr " takes the waist token and turns it over. Seeing the name on the back, he says nothing for a long while."

msgid "逄……是逄义师弟的牌。同辈里他的剑不比我差，只是好赌。"
msgstr "Pang... This is Brother Pang Yi's token. Among our generation his sword was no worse than mine. He was only too fond of gambling."

msgid "牌是真的，人是假的——那就是牌从他手里流出去了。他这些年多半泡在绮云镇的赌场里。"
msgstr "The token is real; the man was not. So it passed out of his hands. These years he has most likely been soaking in the gambling dens of Cloudweave Town."

msgid "你去问他一句：牌是怎么到外人手里的。问明白了，再把牌带回来。"
msgstr "Go and ask him one thing: how the token came into a stranger's hands. When you have the answer, bring the token back."

msgid "把腰牌递还给你。"
msgstr " hands the waist token back to you."

msgid "封山弟子人人有一块腰牌，正面一座山，背面是自己的姓。你的那块，等你的剑入了门再说。"
msgstr "Every Empty Mountain disciple has a waist token: a mountain on the front, the owner's surname on the back. Yours will come when your sword is worthy of the school."

msgid "他肯认，就还是封山的人。"
msgstr "If he owns up, he is still one of Empty Mountain."

msgid "逄师弟与我同辈，剑上的天分不在我之下。……好赌，多年不回武馆了。"
msgstr "Brother Pang is of my generation. His gift with the sword was no less than mine. ...He loves to gamble. He has not come back to the hall in years."

msgid "淳风武馆是先父所创，在下辱承其名，虽忝掌封山门户，不敢忘了先人遗志。"
msgstr "My late father founded Pure Wind Hall, and I am unworthy of the name I bear. I keep the door of the Empty Mountain School only as a caretaker, and I have not forgotten what our forebears meant it to be."

msgid "先父临终之时将这武馆交到在下手中，需得好好照看。"
msgstr "On his deathbed, my late father placed this hall in my hands. I must look after it well."

msgid "刘兄弟在寒舍管事已经五年了，过去之事不须再提。"
msgstr "Brother Liu has kept house for me these five years. What lies in the past need not be raised again."

msgid "你既然知道我是柳馆主，怎麽不知道我是柳淳风？"
msgstr "If you know I am Master Liu, how do you not know I am Liu Chunfeng?"

msgid "这里便是淳风武馆。"
msgstr "This is Pure Wind Hall."

msgid "听说大内的人在黄石隘口挖出了东西，又被人抢了去。抢东西的若是往老松岭去了，多半是投老松寨。"
msgstr "I hear the Palace men dug something up at Yellow Rock Pass, and someone snatched it from them. If the thief went toward Old Pine Ridge, he has most likely gone to Old Pine Stockade."

msgid "老松寨的常老大，人称泼风刀王，什么钱都收。要过他的寨门，带够银子；有本事的，就在寨门外叫阵——硬闯的人，没几个回来。"
msgstr "Boss Chang of Old Pine Stockade — they call him the Storm-Blade King — takes any money going. To pass his gate, bring enough silver. If you have the skill, call him out at the gate. Of those who force their way in, few come back."

msgid "黑冠黑衣的道士？这一带没有道观。你若在老松岭遇上，小心些，那种人下手没有分寸。"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black cap and black robe? There is no abbey around here. If you meet him on Old Pine Ridge, be careful. His kind do not know when to stop."

msgid "老岑的信，你留着。末一行我不认得——他说过他在山里见过一座城，我只当是饿昏了的话。"
msgstr "Keep Old Cen's letter. The last line I cannot make out — he once told me he saw a city in the mountains. I took it for hunger talking."

msgid "接过信，看了很久，又折好还给你。"
msgstr " takes the letter and looks at it a long time, then folds it and gives it back."

msgid "老岑……二十多年前我在山里迷了路，三天没吃东西，是个砍柴的老人领我下的山。他不识几个字——这封信，他写了多久啊。"
msgstr "Old Cen... More than twenty years ago I got lost in the mountains and went three days without food. An old woodcutter led me down. He barely knew how to write — how long this letter must have taken him."

msgid "他托你来，武馆的门你随时进。拜不拜师，你自己定。"
msgstr "He sent you to me, so the hall's door is open to you whenever you like. Whether you become my student is yours to decide."

msgid "末一行我不认得。他说过他在山里见过一座城，铃声满耳……我只当是饿昏了的话。你收好。"
msgstr "The last line I cannot make out. He once told me he saw a city in the mountains, its bells ringing in his ears... I took it for hunger talking. Keep it safe."

msgid "什么信？"
msgstr "What letter?"

msgid "柳淳风的引荐信"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng's Letter of Introduction"

msgid "看了你一眼。"
msgstr " glances at you."

msgid "信没了？……罢了，我再写一封。"
msgstr "The letter is gone? ...Never mind. I will write another."

msgid "提笔又写了一封信，封好了交给你。"
msgstr " takes up his brush, writes another letter, seals it and hands it to you."

msgid "这回收好。潘军禅认信不认人。"
msgstr "Keep this one safe. Pan Junchan honors the letter, not the face."

msgid "信已经给你了。去水烟阁找潘军禅，他是我的结拜义弟，见信如见我。"
msgstr "I have given you the letter. Go to Waterfog Pavilion and find Pan Junchan. He is my sworn brother; my letter is as good as my presence."

msgid "听你说完山洞里的事，沉默了半晌。"
msgstr " hears out what happened in the cave, then is silent a long while."

msgid "洞里那个道士，是你杀的？……头一回手上沾血，夜里睡得着就好。睡不着，来武馆找我，我陪你坐一坐。"
msgstr "The Daoist in the cave — you killed him? ...The first blood on your hands. If you can sleep tonight, good. If you cannot, come to the hall. I will sit with you a while."

msgid "二十年前，振远镖局押一趟镖过老松岭，镖师随从一个都没回来。镖局丢了脸，陈剑秋到今天都不肯提。"
msgstr "Twenty years ago, the Zhenyuan Escorts — the Far-Road Escorts — took a shipment over Old Pine Ridge. Not one guard or porter came back. The agency lost face, and Chen Jianqiu will not speak of it to this day."

msgid "那具骸骨若真是水烟阁的人，这事就该问水烟阁。我写一封信，你拿去给执法使潘军禅，他是我的结拜义弟。"
msgstr "If those bones truly belong to one of Waterfog Pavilion's people, then this is a question for Waterfog Pavilion. I will write a letter. Take it to their Enforcer, Pan Junchan. He is my sworn brother."

msgid "提笔写了一封信，封好了交给你。"
msgstr " takes up his brush, writes a letter, seals it and hands it to you."

msgid "先去绮云镇问问陈剑秋，把镖单要来。上了山，别带着兵刃进阁。"
msgstr "First go to Cloudweave Town and ask Chen Jianqiu for the shipment ledger. When you go up the mountain, do not carry a weapon into the Pavilion."

msgid "还有一件：前夜老松岭上起了火，山下都看得见——是老松寨。那道士的同伙回来了，挨个问寨里的人：匣子在谁手里。夜里睡觉，把门闩上。"
msgstr "One more thing. The night before last there was a fire on Old Pine Ridge — you could see it from the foot of the mountain. It was Old Pine Stockade. That Daoist's friends came back and asked everyone in the stockade, one by one, who has the casket. Bar your door when you sleep."

msgid "水烟阁在青石官道西头的山上，武者同盟的总坛。"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion is on the mountain at the west end of the Bluestone Road. It is the seat of the Martial Alliance."

msgid "虹台上的事定了。封山守封山的规矩。"
msgstr "The Rainbow Terrace is settled. Empty Mountain keeps Empty Mountain's rules."

msgid "封山这一票，正月十七照你说的投。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain votes the way you said, on the seventeenth."

msgid "把手里的茶盏放下，半晌没有说话。"
msgstr " sets down his teacup and says nothing for a long while."

msgid "颜违许了北宗一个座。北宗的人上得了虹台，封山这一票，就跟着颜违走了。"
msgstr "Yan Wei promised the North Branch a seat. If the North Branch can take its place on the Rainbow Terrace, then Empty Mountain's vote goes with Yan Wei."

msgid "那一票不在我手里。你要说什么，去内院同绘心说。"
msgstr "That vote is not in my hands. Whatever you have to say, say it to Huixin in the inner court."

msgid "等盟主回来。二十年了，虹台上那把石椅，封山不替任何人去坐。"
msgstr "We wait for the Alliance Leader to return. Twenty years — and Empty Mountain will sit in that stone chair on the Rainbow Terrace for no one."

msgid "……你是掌门传人。你要这一票投你自己，你开口。"
msgstr "...You are the Master's heir. If you want this vote for yourself, you have only to ask."

msgid "封山这一票，等盟主回来。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain's vote waits for the Alliance Leader to return."

msgid "颜违要把那个「代」字去掉——他去他的。封山的剑不外传，封山的票也不跟着人走。"
msgstr "Yan Wei wants to strike out the word \"Acting.\" Let him. Empty Mountain's sword is not taught to outsiders, and Empty Mountain's vote does not follow a man."

msgid "正月十七的事？湖上的事还没了，说那个早了。"
msgstr "The seventeenth? The business on the lake is not finished. It is too early to speak of that."

msgid "那一票不在我手里。"
msgstr "That vote is not in my hands."

msgid "说过了。封山听你的。"
msgstr "We have been through this. Empty Mountain goes with you."

msgid "看了你很久，点了点头。"
msgstr " looks at you a long while, then nods."

msgid "好。封山听你的。"
msgstr "Good. Empty Mountain goes with you."

msgid "规矩是规矩。北宗的人，我不能再教了。"
msgstr "Rules are rules. I can no longer teach anyone of the North Branch."

msgid "这卷书，你不是已经给了绘心么。……拿回去还她。"
msgstr "Did you not already give this book to Huixin? ...Take it back to her."

msgid "接过书，没有翻开，用袖口把封皮上的灰擦了。"
msgstr " takes the book without opening it, and wipes the dust from the cover with his sleeve."

msgid "直竹贵地生……二十岁写的。那时候以为自己什么都懂。"
msgstr "Straight bamboo, rooted deep... I wrote this at twenty. I thought I understood everything then."

msgid "年轻时的糊涂话，收起来罢。"
msgstr "Foolish words from my youth. Put them away."

msgid "把书收进了案头的匣里。"
msgstr " puts the book in the box on his desk."

msgid "绘心这些日子常往内院去，一去就是半天。你改日替我看一眼。"
msgstr "Huixin goes to the inner court often these days, and stays half the day. Look in on her for me sometime."

msgid "这卷书……你从竹林里取出来的？先留着读。武馆的事办完了，再同我说。"
msgstr "This book... you brought it out of the bamboo grove? Keep it and read it for now. When the hall's business is done, we will talk."

msgid "把腰牌收进袖里。"
msgstr " tucks the waist token into his sleeve."

msgid "找回来了？我替他收着。"
msgstr "You found it? I will keep it for him."

msgid "牌我替他收着。他什么时候戒了赌，什么时候自己来取。"
msgstr "I will keep the token for him. When he gives up gambling, he can come for it himself."

msgid "牌是逄师弟的。你先去绮云镇问他一句，牌是怎么到外人手里的。"
msgstr "The token is Brother Pang's. First go to Cloudweave Town and ask him how it came into a stranger's hands."

msgid "你跟了她。……也好。她一个人，我不放心。"
msgstr "You went with her. ...Perhaps that is best. I would not want her on her own."

msgid "武馆的门不拦你。剑，我不能再教了——规矩是规矩。"
msgstr "The hall's door is not closed to you. But the sword I can no longer teach you — rules are rules."

msgid "刘兄弟的事，李教头回过我了。规矩是先父立的，我不能为他破。"
msgstr "Instructor Li has told me about Brother Liu. The rule was my father's; I cannot break it for him."

msgid "五年前我留他，是我的事；今天你说破，是你的事。都没有错。"
msgstr "Five years ago I kept him on; that was my doing. Today you spoke it aloud; that was yours. Neither of us was wrong."

msgid "……说到规矩。我年轻时在天驼关的竹林里留过一卷书，写的也是这两个字。改日同你说。"
msgstr "...Speaking of rules. When I was young I left a book in the bamboo grove at Camelback Pass, and that is what it was about. I will tell you of it some other day."

msgid "李教头说，那伙人认错了人。"
msgstr "Instructor Li says those men had the wrong man."

msgid "看了你很久。"
msgstr " looks at you for a long while."

msgid "刘兄弟的来历，五年前我就知道。你替他担了这句话——往后，也替武馆担着。"
msgstr "I have known where Brother Liu came from for five years. You took that word on his behalf — from now on, carry it for the hall as well."

msgid "你跟了绘心，就是北宗的人。本宗的门，我不能再为你开。"
msgstr "You went with Huixin, so you belong to the North Branch. I can no longer open our school's door to you."

msgid "学剑之人必须胆大心细，依我看$RESPECT的资质似乎不宜？"
msgstr "One who studies the sword must be bold and careful both. To my eye, $RESPECT, your gifts do not seem suited to it."

msgid "很好，$RESPECT多加努力，他日必定有成。"
msgstr "Very good, $RESPECT. Work hard, and one day you will surely succeed."

msgid "瘀伤"
msgstr "bruise"

msgid "抓伤"
msgstr "scratch"

msgid "刺伤"
msgstr "stab wound"

msgid "$N注视著$n的行动，企图寻找机会出手。"
msgstr "$N {N:watch|watches} $n's every move, looking for a chance to strike."

msgid "$N正盯著$n的一举一动，随时准备发动攻势。"
msgstr "$N {N:keep|keeps} a close eye on $n, ready to attack at any moment."

msgid "$N缓缓地移动脚步，想要找出$n的破绽。"
msgstr "$N {N:shift|shifts} slowly on {N:his} feet, hunting for a gap in $n's guard."

msgid "$N目不转睛地盯著$n的动作，寻找进攻的最佳时机。"
msgstr "$N {N:stare|stares} hard at $n, waiting for the perfect moment to attack."

msgid "$N慢慢地移动著脚步，伺机出手。"
msgstr "$N {N:edge|edges} slowly about, biding {N:his} time."

msgid "$N哈哈大笑，说道：承让了！"
msgstr "$N {N:laugh|laughs} out loud. \"Thanks for going easy on me!\""

msgid "$N双手一拱，笑著说道：承让！"
msgstr "$N {N:clasp|clasps} {N:his} hands with a grin. \"You went easy on me!\""

msgid "$N胜了这招，向後跃开三尺，笑道：承让！"
msgstr "$N {N:take|takes} the exchange and {N:spring|springs} back three paces, laughing. \"Thanks for going easy on me!\""

msgid "$n脸色微变，说道：佩服，佩服！"
msgstr "$n {n:pale|pales} a little. \"Impressive. Truly impressive!\""

msgid "$n向後退了几步，说道：这场比试算我输了，佩服，佩服！"
msgstr "$n {n:fall|falls} back a few steps. \"This bout is yours. Impressive — truly impressive!\""

msgid "$n向後一纵，躬身做揖说道：阁下武艺不凡，果然高明！"
msgstr "$n {n:spring|springs} back and {n:bow|bows}, fist in palm. \"Your skill is remarkable. Masterful indeed!\""

msgid "$N受到$n的内力反震，闷哼一声。"
msgstr "$N {N:are|is} jolted by $n's inner force and {N:grunt|grunts}."

msgid "$N被$n以内力反震，「嘿」地一声退了两步。"
msgstr "$n's inner force throws $N back two steps. \"Hngh!\""

msgid "$N被$n以内力一震，胸口有如受到一记重击，连退了五六步！"
msgstr "$n's inner force hits $N like a hammer to the chest — $N {N:stagger|staggers} back five or six steps!"

msgid "$N被$n的内力一震，眼前一黑，身子向後飞出丈许！！"
msgstr "$n's inner force slams into $N. Everything goes black, and $N {N:fly|flies} a good ten feet backward!!"

msgid "$N一击不中，露出了破绽！"
msgstr "$N {N:miss|misses} and {N:leave|leaves} an opening!"

msgid "$N见$n攻击失误，趁机发动攻击！"
msgstr "$N {N:see|sees} $n's attack go wide and {N:seize|seizes} the chance!"

msgid "结果没有造成任何伤害。"
msgstr "It does no harm at all."

msgid "擦伤"
msgstr "graze"

msgid "割伤"
msgstr "cut"

msgid "结果只是轻轻地划破$p的皮肉。"
msgstr "It barely breaks {n:his} skin."

msgid "结果在$p$l划出一道细长的血痕。"
msgstr "It leaves a long, thin line of blood across {n:his} $l."

msgid "结果「嗤」地一声划出一道伤口！"
msgstr "With a hiss, it opens a wound!"

msgid "结果「嗤」地一声划出一道血淋淋的伤口！"
msgstr "With a hiss, it opens a bloody wound!"

msgid "结果「嗤」地一声划出一道又长又深的伤口，溅得$N满脸鲜血！"
msgstr "With a hiss, it opens a long, deep wound — blood sprays all over $N's face!"

msgid "结果只听见$n一声惨嚎，$w已在$p$l划出一道深及见骨的可怕伤口！！"
msgstr "$n {n:let|lets} out a terrible scream as $N's $w carves a gruesome wound to the bone in {n:his} $l!!"

msgid "结果只是轻轻地刺破$p的皮肉。"
msgstr "It barely pricks {n:his} skin."

msgid "结果在$p$l刺出一个创口。"
msgstr "It leaves a puncture in {n:his} $l."

msgid "结果「噗」地一声刺入了$n$l寸许！"
msgstr "With a thud, it sinks an inch into $n's $l!"

msgid "结果「噗」地一声刺进$n的$l，使$p不由自主地退了几步！"
msgstr "With a thud, it drives into $n's $l, forcing {n:him} back a few steps!"

msgid "结果「噗嗤」地一声，$w已在$p$l刺出一个血肉模糊的血窟窿！"
msgstr "With a wet thud, $N's $w punches a bloody hole in {n:his} $l!"

msgid "结果只听见$n一声惨嚎，$w已在$p的$l对穿而出，鲜血溅得满地！！"
msgstr "$n {n:let|lets} out a terrible scream as $N's $w runs clean through {n:his} $l — blood everywhere!!"

msgid "结果只是轻轻地碰到，比拍苍蝇稍微重了点。"
msgstr "It barely lands — a little harder than swatting a fly."

msgid "结果在$p的$l造成一处瘀青。"
msgstr "It leaves a bruise on {n:his} $l."

msgid "结果一击命中，$n的$l登时肿了一块老高！"
msgstr "A clean hit — $n's $l swells up at once!"

msgid "结果一击命中，$n闷哼了一声显然吃了不小的亏！"
msgstr "A clean hit — $n {n:grunt|grunts}, clearly hurting."

msgid "结果「砰」地一声，$n退了两步！"
msgstr "Thud! $n {n:stagger|staggers} back two steps!"

msgid "结果这一下「砰」地一声打得$n连退了好几步，差一点摔倒！"
msgstr "Thud! The blow knocks $n back several steps — {n:he} nearly {n:go|goes} down!"

msgid "结果重重地击中，$n「哇」地一声吐出一口鲜血！"
msgstr "A heavy hit — $n {n:cough|coughs} up a mouthful of blood!"

msgid "结果只听见「砰」地一声巨响，$n像一捆稻草般飞了出去！！"
msgstr "With a mighty thud, $n {n:go|goes} flying like a bundle of straw!!"

msgid "结果只是勉强造成一处轻微{type}！"
msgstr "It barely leaves a light {type}!"

msgid "结果造成轻微的{type}！"
msgstr "It leaves a light {type}!"

msgid "结果造成一处{type}！"
msgstr "It leaves a {type}!"

msgid "结果造成一处严重{type}！"
msgstr "It leaves a serious {type}!"

msgid "结果造成颇为严重的{type}！"
msgstr "It leaves a rather serious {type}!"

msgid "结果造成相当严重的{type}！"
msgstr "It leaves a very serious {type}!"

msgid "结果造成十分严重的{type}！"
msgstr "It leaves an extremely serious {type}!"

msgid "结果造成极其严重的{type}！"
msgstr "It leaves a grievous {type}!"

msgid "结果造成非常可怕的严重{type}！"
msgstr "It leaves a horrifying {type}!"

msgid "伤害"
msgstr "wound"

msgid "看起来气血充盈，并没有受伤。"
msgstr "{N:look|looks} hale and unhurt."

msgid "似乎受了点轻伤，不过光从外表看不大出来。"
msgstr "{N:seem|seems} lightly hurt, though it hardly shows."

msgid "看起来可能受了点轻伤。"
msgstr "{N:look|looks} like {N:he} might be lightly hurt."

msgid "受了几处伤，不过似乎并不碍事。"
msgstr "{N:have|has} taken a few wounds, but nothing serious."

msgid "受伤不轻，看起来状况并不太好。"
msgstr "{N:are|is} hurt badly and {N:look|looks} in poor shape."

msgid "气息粗重，动作开始散乱，看来所受的伤著实不轻。"
msgstr "{N:are|is} breathing hard, movements getting ragged — those wounds are no joke."

msgid "已经伤痕累累，正在勉力支撑著不倒下去。"
msgstr "{N:are|is} covered in wounds, struggling to stay on {N:his} feet."

msgid "受了相当重的伤，只怕会有生命危险。"
msgstr "{N:are|is} gravely wounded — {N:his} life may be in danger."

msgid "伤重之下已经难以支撑，眼看就要倒在地上。"
msgstr "{N:are|is} too badly hurt to hold out much longer — about to hit the ground."

msgid "受伤过重，已经奄奄一息，命在旦夕了。"
msgstr "{N:are|is} at death's door, barely breathing."

msgid "受伤过重，已经有如风中残烛，随时都可能断气。"
msgstr "{N:are|is} a candle in the wind, ready to go out at any moment."

msgid "看起来充满活力，一点也不累。"
msgstr "{N:look|looks} full of energy, not tired at all."

msgid "似乎有些疲惫，但是仍然十分有活力。"
msgstr "{N:seem|seems} a bit tired, but still plenty lively."

msgid "看起来可能有些累了。"
msgstr "{N:look|looks} like {N:he} might be getting tired."

msgid "动作似乎开始有点不太灵光，但是仍然有条不紊。"
msgstr "{N:are|is} starting to slow down, but still holding it together."

msgid "气喘嘘嘘，看起来状况并不太好。"
msgstr "{N:are|is} gasping for breath and {N:look|looks} in poor shape."

msgid "似乎十分疲惫，看来需要好好休息了。"
msgstr "{N:seem|seems} worn out — badly in need of rest."

msgid "已经一副头重脚轻的模样，正在勉力支撑著不倒下去。"
msgstr "{N:are|is} light-headed and heavy-footed, struggling to stay upright."

msgid "看起来已经力不从心了。"
msgstr "{N:look|looks} completely spent."

msgid "摇头晃脑、歪歪斜斜地站都站不稳，眼看就要倒在地上。"
msgstr "{N:are|is} reeling and swaying, barely able to stand — about to drop."

msgid "已经陷入半昏迷状态，随时都可能摔倒晕去。"
msgstr "{N:are|is} half-conscious, ready to keel over at any moment."

msgid "中性神"
msgstr "genderless"

msgid "他"
msgstr "him"

msgid "她"
msgstr "her"

msgid "它"
msgstr "it"

msgid "挫伤"
msgstr "contusion"

msgid "鞭伤"
msgstr "welt"

msgid "挥拳"
msgstr "Punch"

msgid "$N挥拳攻击$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:throw|throws} a punch at $n's $l"

msgid "一抓"
msgstr "Grab"

msgid "$N往$n的$l一抓"
msgstr "$N {N:grab|grabs} at $n's $l"

msgid "踢腿"
msgstr "Kick"

msgid "$N往$n的$l狠狠地踢了一脚"
msgstr "$N {N:kick|kicks} hard at $n's $l"

