msgstr "Spend {force} Inner Force to restore {track}"

msgid "用 {force} 点内力和 {sen} 点神恢复法力"
msgstr "Spend {force} Inner Force and {sen} Spirit to restore Arcane Power"

msgid "用 {force} 点内力，一段时间内攻击和闪避提升，杀气也随之上升"
msgstr "Spend {force} Inner Force: attack and dodge rise for a while, and so does your Bloodlust"

msgid "用 {force} 点内力和 {sen} 点神压下杀气，战斗中可能昏倒"
msgstr "Spend {force} Inner Force and {sen} Spirit to suppress your Bloodlust; you may pass out mid-fight"

msgid "用 {force} 点内力和 {kee} 点气长啸，在场受不住的人都会受伤"
msgstr "Spend {force} Inner Force and {kee} Qi on a roar that wounds everyone here who can't take it"

msgid "用 {force} 点内力和 {sen} 点神以目光摄住对手，伤其精（对手可能避开）"
msgstr "Spend {force} Inner Force and {sen} Spirit to pin your opponent with a stare, wounding their Essence (they may evade)"

msgid "脱离战斗，回到{region}{room}（{mana} 法力，可能失败）"
msgstr "Escape the fight and return to {room}, {region} ({mana} Arcane Power, may fail)"

msgid "困住对手，让对方一段时间无法出手（{mana} 法力，可能失败）"
msgstr "Bind your opponent so they can't act for a while ({mana} Arcane Power, may fail)"

msgid "召来一名天将相助（{mana} 法力，可能失败）"
msgstr "Summon a heavenly general to help ({mana} Arcane Power, may fail)"

msgid "召来一名天将或阴鬼卒相助（{mana} 法力、{sen} 神，可能失败）"
msgstr "Summon a heavenly general or ghost soldier to help ({mana} Arcane Power, {sen} Spirit, may fail)"

msgid "看得见鬼魂，持续的秒数等于你的有效咒文等级（{mana} 法力、{sen} 神）"
msgstr "See ghosts for as many seconds as your effective Incantation level ({mana} Arcane Power, {sen} Spirit)"

